 426:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * @brief Runs all the Tasks of the Motor Control cockpit
 427:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  *
 428:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * This function is to be called periodically at least at the Medium Frequency task
 429:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * rate (It is typically called on the Systick interrupt). Exact invokation rate is
 430:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * the Speed regulator execution rate set in the Motor Contorl Workbench.
 431:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  *
 432:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * The following tasks are executed in this order:
 433:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  *
 434:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * - Medium Frequency Tasks of each motors
 435:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * - Safety Task
 436:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * - Power Factor Correction Task (if enabled)
 437:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  * - User Interface task.
 438:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****  */
