1001:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c **** /**
1002:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****   * @brief  It computes the new values of Iqdref (current references on qd
1003:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_tasks.c ****   *         reference frame) based on the required electrical torque information
